{"metadata": {"team_id": "uva", "run_id": "mq4cs-gpt41-splade", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "6-1_13", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "Mesotherapy is a cosmetic treatment that involves injecting vitamins, enzymes, hormones, and plant extracts into the skin to rejuvenate and tighten it, as well as to remove excess fat. Unlike microneedling, which uses tiny needles to create micro-injuries on the skin's surface to stimulate collagen production, mesotherapy directly delivers nutrients into deeper skin layers.   While both treatments aim to improve skin appearance, they work differently. Microneedling is often preferred for overall skin rejuvenation, helping to reduce the appearance of scars, dark spots, and large pores, as well as improving skin texture. It is suitable for a wide range of skin types and tones, with minimal downtime and low risk of complications. On the other hand, mesotherapy can target specific skin concerns with customized ingredients, but it may involve more discomfort due to the injections and can come with a higher risk of side effects such as bruising or swelling.  Choosing between the two depends on your specific skin goals and concerns. For overall skin rejuvenation and minimal downtime, microneedling may be more suitable based on your interest in treatments with quick recovery.", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0037-79-06507:2": 3.382083091915513, "clueweb22-en0041-58-07171:1": 3.2102807875609356, "clueweb22-en0037-79-06507:1": 2.6808217768247498, "clueweb22-en0033-70-02855:1": 2.619847876626351, "clueweb22-en0020-68-08676:3": 2.355244626814318, "clueweb22-en0020-68-08676:4": 2.2889871660433148, "clueweb22-en0040-90-12567:1": 1.9114701303200397, "clueweb22-en0041-58-07171:2": 1.8818845933552946, "clueweb22-en0005-98-19840:7": 1.7868961422705523, "clueweb22-en0041-58-07171:0": 1.7055784178547269}, "ptkb_provenance": []}], "references": {"clueweb22-en0037-79-06507:2": 3.382083091915513, "clueweb22-en0041-58-07171:1": 3.2102807875609356, "c